Subject: model running too slow and does not converge with database-like organizing for ragged data structure
Message-ID: <DULpvchZmOA.MThZD3ZvCAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/DULpvchZmOA/m/MThZD3ZvCAAJ>
