Look at the the trace plots, pairs plot, if the model fits nicely.
At the latent structure:
First start with a simple intercept. Then exchange the intercept by a Markov chain...
hierarchical model, etc. or what makes sense.
Then improve at the distribution function level.

Deriving the probability is simple math.

Thats just my 2 cents,
