Dear Stan users,

We are currently working on facilitating Stan for ODE based models, see wiki <https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/wiki/Complex-ODE-Based-Models>. Developers working on the project seem to be mostly familiar with pharmacometrics and system biology. We would like to learn about other potential applications, and what users may be looking for. For more discussion on the subject, see this thread <https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/stan-dev/xGlyeLkdSiE> on the development list.

Since this is posted on the user list, the discussion should really focus on users' needs. Implementation details should be discussed in the development list.

Thank you for your help!

~ Charles

