Subject: Re: [stan-users] Multivariate Probit (once again)
Message-ID: <2ztLqIJ67_M._xc8DISbAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <2ztLqIJ67_M.0g2aOXdZAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <2ztLqIJ67_M.n2x382udAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <2ztLqIJ67_M.0g2aOXdZAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/2ztLqIJ67_M/m/_xc8DISbAgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
