From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Mon Aug 15 23:16:10 2016
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Mon, 15 Aug 2016 23:16:10 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Multivariate Probit (once again)
Message-ID: <2ztLqIJ67_M.4OSdJsSfAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <2ztLqIJ67_M._xc8DISbAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <2ztLqIJ67_M.n2x382udAAAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <2ztLqIJ67_M._xc8DISbAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/2ztLqIJ67_M/m/4OSdJsSfAgAJ>
