From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 16 01:26:10 2016
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 16 Aug 2016 01:26:10 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Default priors vs. Uniformly distribution
Message-ID: <LTKfmawaQlw.U80FiNymAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <LTKfmawaQlw.p_xu38KkAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <LTKfmawaQlw.vDYZrnuNAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <LTKfmawaQlw.p_xu38KkAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/LTKfmawaQlw/m/U80FiNymAgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
