Subject: what is the unit/scale for priors
Message-ID: <_y6aDbkdANw.-ch3qpQ-AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/_y6aDbkdANw/m/-ch3qpQ-AwAJ>
